OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fsoon clearing, then skies will turn
OL,7,Fclearer throughout this evening,
OL,8,Fallowing temperatures to drop away.
OL,9,FRemaining dry overnight but feeling
OL,10,Frather chilly under light northerly
OL,11,Fwinds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CMonday:FA bright start on Monday.
OL,14,FBecoming slightly cloudier from the
OL,15,Feast through the day, though sunny
OL,16,Fspells will persist and it will remain
OL,17,Fdry. Feeling fresher in a northerly
OL,18,Fbreeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
